# 27. Final Rendering Pipeline

The implementation must ultimately behave as follows.

## Initial chart

```text
Load OHLCV
    ↓
Create DataModel
    ↓
Configure:
    bar_spacing = 6.0
    min_bar_spacing = 0.5
    right_offset = 5
    top_margin = 0.20
    bottom_margin = 0.10
    overscan = 20
    wick_width = 1
    ↓
Calculate visible range
    ↓
Calculate price range
    ↓
Calculate candle width
    ↓
Create Canvas item pool
    ↓
Render visible + 20 overscan
```

## Pan

```text
mouse press
    ↓
store mouse position
    ↓
mouse drag
    ↓
pixel_delta
    ↓
logical_delta = pixel_delta / bar_spacing
    ↓
update fractional viewport
    ↓
calculate visible range
    ↓
reuse Canvas items
    ↓
update coordinates
    ↓
render
```

## Zoom

```text
wheel
    ↓
cursor_x → float logical index
    ↓
new_spacing =
    spacing + zoom_scale × spacing / 10
    ↓
clamp >= 0.5
    ↓
restore logical index under cursor
    ↓
calculate visible range
    ↓
calculate candle width
    ↓
update Canvas geometry
    ↓
render
```

## Crosshair

```text
mouse move
    ↓
x → logical index
y → price
    ↓
magnet/snap
    ↓
update crosshair Canvas items
    ↓
render overlay only
```

## New candle

```text
new OHLCV
    ↓
DataModel update
    ↓
update logical count
    ↓
update visible range if follow-latest
    ↓
update price range
    ↓
update affected Canvas items
    ↓
render
```

